    test: widen OPS-007 stall/budget margin (full-suite flake) + gitreins tier2 cap 4M→10M
    
    - serving-paths-ops007: SYNC_STALL_MS 1500→2500 while HEARTBEAT_BUDGET_MS
      stays 1000. Under full-suite load the scheduler can push a heartbeat gap
      past 1000ms on a healthy loop; the wider stall keeps the pre-fix signature
      (gap >= stall) unmistakable and the post-fix budget comfortably clear.
      This flake failed DF-0919-02 tier1 while its tier2 PASSED.
    - .gitreins/config.yaml: max_input_tokens 4M→10M (gitreins default). The 4M
      override starved DF-0919-01 tier2's clean-install reproduce exploration.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
